              <cell />
            </row>
            <row>
              <cell>Simplify the fraction.</cell>
              <cell />
            </row>
            <row>
              <cell>Check:</cell>
              <cell />
              <cell />
            </row>
            <row>
              <cell>Substitute $$y = - \frac{1}{4}$$.</cell>
              <cell />
              <cell />
            </row>
            <row>
              <cell>Rewrite as fractions with the LCD.</cell>
              <cell />
              <cell />
            </row>
            <row>
              <cell>Add.</cell>
              <cell />
              <cell />
            </row>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p>Since $$y + \frac{9}{16} = \frac{5}{16}$$ makes $$y + \frac{11}{12} = \frac{5}{12}.$$ a true statement, we know we have found the solution to this equation.</p>
      </solution>
    </example>
